  "limitations": [
    "3D仅FIRE主控；K014-B的轮子、N20电机/编码器、Mega328控制板、支架与电池模块不在本模型中，不虚构整车装配。",
    "Related K007-V27 manufacturer enclosure geometry is an exterior approximation only. Exact K014-B parameter table remains16MB Flash,4MB PSRAM and ILI9341; no v2.7 runtime, memory, LCD or firmware identity is inherited.",
    "Original related source triangles retain one rigid translation and no scaling; source depth20.6mm differs from nominal21mm controller. Cosmetic revision, front bezel and connector insertion depths remain estimated; no1:1 photo/side-view acceptance.",
    "M5_Hardware complete source inventory has no exact K014/Bala CAD. Related source components0/19 are the separate charging dock and all print-layout duplicates are excluded.",
    "PCB is an explicit UNKNOWN placeholder; no populated board CAD or hidden battery/component arrangement is inferred from a schematic or a related SKU.",
    "No board execution, self-balancing dynamics, wheel/encoder, motor-driver I2C0x56, IMU, RGB, audio, battery management or card transport is implemented.",
    "Own table lists BMM150+(MPU6886/SH200Q); actual sensor/PCB revision is unresolved. Family M5Bala code references MPU6050; its exact K014-B factory applicability is not proven.",
    "No static product or firmware screenshot covers the real framebuffer. Key caps, front bezel, diffusers and connectors keep separate materials.",
    "Port signal assignments and pin1 mating are unverified for this exact SKU. Cable connections remain disabled. Visible screws, magnets and POGO contacts are not reconstructed.",
    "The prepared64MiB FAT32 card is local configuration only; no K014-B SD bus is connected to guest firmware. Browser, physical hardware and exact firmware validation remain unperformed."
